      {
        id: 'one-time',
        title: 'One-time purchase, lifetime access',
        paras: [
          'Each course is sold as a one-time payment. Once the payment is confirmed, the course appears in My courses and you can study every lesson, including lessons added later, for as long as zuey.me operates.',
