        ],
      },
      {
        id: 'seller',
        title: 'Seller (Merchant of Record)',
        paras: [
          'When you pay by card, the transaction is processed by Dodo Payments acting as Merchant of Record: Dodo Payments is the official seller of that order and handles payment collection, tax, invoicing, refunds and payment disputes. Dodo Payments may appear on your card statement. The Dodo Payments buyer terms also apply to that transaction; the refund right in this policy is in addition to, and does not replace, any right you have under the Dodo Payments terms.',
          'When you pay by Vietnamese bank transfer through VietQR (SePay), the seller is Duy Nguyen (Zuey), who provides the course content on zuey.me.',
